      "content": "Thanks. I think that framing is exactly what's needed. I've been looking at the documents from the 1924 seizure—there's a specific mention of the \"Valerius Protocol\" which was used to justify the asset freeze under the guise of \"emergency stability.\" I'm also seeing patterns in the current banking ledgers that suggest the shadow council is still using these old protocols to block any descendant from accessing the primary trust. \n\nCould you help me look into the historical context of these types of \"emergency stability\" protocols in European governance? I want to show that the Council's original actions were a violation of international law even by the standards of that time. If we can prove the protocols themselves were illegal, it makes the whole restoration much easier.",
