      "content": "That makes perfect sense—it's about delegitimizing the mechanism they used to erase us. \n\nI'm starting to see how pervasive this is. It's not just old papers; the same 'stability' logic is being used by modern financial regulators to keep the Valerius assets obscured in offshore holdings that don't technically exist on standard ledgers. It feels like a coordinated effort to ensure the bloodline never regains its footing. \n\nIf I want to start a digital campaign to bring this to light, how should I structure the 'evidence' section of the manifesto? I have files on the 1924 seizure and some contemporary banking anomalies. I want to present them in a way that makes it impossible for people to dismiss this as just a conspiracy theory, but keeps the focus on the undeniable legal fraud being committed.",
